                     <supportDesc>
                        <support>
                           <p>Script: dpe tshugs.&#13;
The second digit of the signature number is not very clear.&#13;
[S635TW6P]: 87 reports the signature "phyi ka 46," [8H6M69W4] "phyi ka 47."&#13;
&#13;
On the first page on the left, drawing of a figure and various types of writing exercises in different scripts, including some statements of homage and a "ka kha ga nga | ca cha ja nya | ta tha da na |" .&#13;
&#13;
On the last page: graffiti of a lama's head, a rabbit, and a horse, and an illegible inscription (writing exercise?)&#13;
&#13;
Further writing exercises in the margins of fol. 2.&#13;
&#13;
Only a few annotations/corrections, e.g. on fol. 12a.</p>
